2487: /* When the whole field boxes together, the pit lane is a shared road. Keep each
2488:    car a few lengths behind the next one in the same direction so the pack queues
2489:    into the lane instead of driving through itself. A car parked in its box is
2490:    ignored: it has pulled left to the garage, leaving the through-lane clear. */
